# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Same Supabase project as the Android app's app/env.json. Use the
# PUBLISHABLE key (sb_publishable_...) — never the service_role/secret key.
# Both values are shipped to the browser by design: every table they can reach
# is protected by RLS, reports and appeals are insert-only, and the readable
# views expose aggregates only.
#
# Leaving these unset is a supported configuration. The site still builds and
# every risk verdict still works, because scoring is entirely on-device; only
# the community list, reporting and live stats go quiet.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_KEY=
